    [CI][Misc] Run Qwen3-32B QuaRot Eagle3 nightly in graph mode and update baseline (#18320)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    Switch the Qwen3-32B-QuaRot Eagle3 nightly performance case to graph
    mode and calibrate its output-token throughput baseline from measured
    Nightly-A3 results.
    
    - Remove `--enforce-eager` and `--no-enable-prefix-caching`.
    - Set `cudagraph_mode` to `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`.
    - Enable `enable_flashcomm1` and `enable_npugraph_ex`, with
    `enable_static_kernel` disabled.
    - Update the performance baseline from `371.4166` to `730.8368` token/s.
    Keep the threshold at `0.97`, giving a minimum passing throughput of
    `708.911696` token/s.
    
    The baseline is the arithmetic mean of these four formal performance
    results from this PR on 2026-10-12:
    
    | Run | Output throughput (token/s) | Nightly job |
    | --- | ---: | --- |
    | 1 | 716.4578 |
    [38193037753](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/actions/runs/38193037753/job/114630845664)
    |
    | 2 | 725.8534 |
    [38195966370](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/actions/runs/38195966370/job/114639985608)
    |
    | 3 | 734.8305 |
    [38202452894](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/actions/runs/38202452894/job/114659857062)
    |
    | 5 | 746.2053 |
    [38216278390](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/actions/runs/38216278390/job/114703624285)
    |
    
    `(716.4578 + 725.8534 + 734.8305 + 746.2053) / 4 = 730.83675`, rounded
    to four decimal places.
    
    The fourth run
    ([38211105173](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/actions/runs/38211105173/job/114686466964)),
    which reported `775.1442` token/s and higher speculative acceptance, is
    excluded from this calibration. Keep the existing warmup and benchmark
    workload.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    No. Only the end-to-end nightly benchmark configuration and its
    performance acceptance baseline change.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    - All four linked Nightly-A3 performance runs passed: 80 successful
    requests, zero failures, 292753 input tokens, and 120000 output tokens
    per run.
    - Parsed the YAML and embedded JSON arguments successfully. Compared the
    configuration with the preceding PR commit and verified that the
    calibration changes only `benchmarks.perf.baseline`; `threshold` remains
    `0.97`.
    - `git diff --check` passed.
    - Addressed argument-quoting consistency for `"--compilation-config"`;
    parsed YAML before and after this cosmetic change is identical.
    - `pre-commit run codespell --files
    tests/e2e/cases/models/configs/Qwen/Qwen3-32B-QuaRot-eagle3.yaml
    --hook-stage manual` passed.
    - `pre-commit run typos --files
    tests/e2e/cases/models/configs/Qwen/Qwen3-32B-QuaRot-eagle3.yaml
    --hook-stage manual` passed.
    - Attempted the repository `format.sh ci` check through WSL with CRLF
    normalized in memory. The full check could not complete because
    actionlint's environment installation failed with `SSL:
    CERTIFICATE_VERIFY_FAILED` (a self-signed certificate in the chain).
    Full formatting verification remains pending CI.
    
